  "verseCount": 9,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha sha kūgunanha beela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ahene natī na nguno ya kwikala nūng'wandīkīla ī mihayo ya kūbagunanha beela yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nabūmanile ū būgaagaanu wing'we, ūbo nose būkūnenhelejaga kwikumīlīja kū bana Makedonia kūlwa nguno ying'we. Nakūbawīlaga gīkī, ī Akaya ī yene īmalīīlile kwīngīīla ng'wakīzo; nose ū būkalalwa wing'we wabamishije bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nalībatūma a badūgū benaba gīkī ū wikumīlīja wise kūlwa nguno ying'we būtizūbiza bo dalali ū mu mhayo gwenūyū, musangwe muligolanya gīt'ūmo namalaga kūhaya gīkī, musangwe mumalīīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana Makedonia batiziza hamò nane bamusange mutaalī ū kūmalīja ī milonjo tūkagooka; natūhayaga mukūgooka bing'we, nguno tūmusanije no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene naabonile īlī yawiza kūbalomba a badūgū batonge ko, bize balonje lonje ī mihayo ya winhi wenūbū, ūbo ng'wamala kwisagīja kūfuma kale; gīkī būbize winhi ng'hana, gūtī mhayo gwa kūhadīkījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī yoi ījile gīkī, ūyo ūbība mu nyagugīji akūgesa sha nyagugīji, nū yūyo ūbība mu wiza ng'holò akūgesa īsho shiigeleelilwe wiza ng'holò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'wene ni afunyage gīt'ūmo alībonela mung'holò yakwe; ītī mu būzongu zongu nūūlū kwibona gītī alīhadīkījiwa. Nguno ū Mulungu akayejiagwa na būlī ng'wene ūyo akafunyaga mu būyegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu adūgije kūjīīta pyī ī lubango jimukwīlīle, mubize na shikolo sha būlī mbika sha kūng'wigela mu yose būlī lūshikū, shimukwīlīle no no no kūlwa būlī nīmo gwawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gīt'ūmo gwandīkilwe gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
